OL,4,BGloucs CEO 'confident' Bristol rebrand 
OL,5,Bwill work                              
OL,6,GGloucestershire are "really confident" 
OL,7,Gtheir rebrand to Bristol Lions for the 
OL,8,GT20 Blast will work, says outgoing     
OL,9,Gchief executive Neil Priscott.         
OL,11,FThe club will change their name from   
OL,12,F2027 for the competition,              
OL,13,Fincorporating the city where their     
OL,14,Fhome stadium is based.                 
OL,16,FPriscott, who will be stepping down in 
OL,17,FDecember after seven-and a-half-years  
OL,18,Fat the county, said the change was     
OL,19,Fmade to help make them more            
OL,20,Fsustainable for the future.            
